BEHAVIOR round

DESCRIPTION
  x rounded to the nearest integer, half away from zero, returned as an int.
  Adds +0.5 (x>=0) or -0.5 (x<0) then truncates. round(2.5)=3, round(-2.5)=-3,
  round(2.4)=2.

CONTRACT
  INPUT x float 8
  OUTPUT result int 8
  GUARANTEES pure no_alloc writes_output

HASH b6cfd5dd

IMPLEMENTATION
  xv = LOAD x 8
  zero = ITOF 0 8 8
  one = ITOF 1 8 8
  two = ITOF 2 8 8
  half = FDIV one two 8
  neg = FLT xv zero 8
  BRANCH neg negc posc
  LABEL posc
    adj = FADD xv half 8
    JUMP rdone
  LABEL negc
    adj = FSUB xv half 8
  LABEL rdone
    r = FTOI adj 8 8
    STORE result r 8
END
